WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.300
Üso and the Shrike Team...

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.860
...successfully attacked Pippiniden's fleet.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:38.560
However, Üso was exhausted after hearing Lupe Cineau's voice.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:44.500
As the League Militaire Fleet enters Angel Halo's airspace,

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:48.900
they're oppressed by the sound of bells enveloping them.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.960
FUALA, THE COMET OF THE BATTLEFIELD

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.730
"Fuala, the Comet of the Battlefield".

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.400
It looks like the final assembly is complete.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:16.500
Still, I don't think it's fully operational.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:19.430
That's due to its scale.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.930
Hopefully, it'll take time before it can achieve its expected capabilities.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:29.460
Not breaking through Pippiniden's Motorad Fleet in one go was a failure on our part.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.560
If the Federation had just given us more reinforcements...

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:34.460
It wasn't that.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.500
BESPA's defenses are stronger than we imagined.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:41.860
What lies before us is what they call the Tassilo Fleet,

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.960
along with remnants of the Motorad Fleet.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:49.830
Additionally, there's the Sugan Fleet spread around Angel Halo.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.060
Not to mention that giant saucer-riding mobile suit.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.100
There's also talk that those bell sounds aren't coming from that mobile suit,

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:59.930
but rather from Angel Halo's airspace.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.260
Still, it's odd.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.730
What is?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.100
If something that massive had been brought into the Earth Sphere,

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.200
a space colony somewhere would have detected it.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.030
Um...

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.930
You have something to say, Üso?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:17.700
There are lots of ships traveling between Jupiter and Earth, right?

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:21.600
Couldn't they have transported the construction materials...

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.930
...for Angel Halo here in pieces?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.400
I see.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:28.430
Fonse Kagatie comes from Jupiter.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:29.830
That's right.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:32.260
I've also heard that those people who collect helium 3...

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:36.000
...have formed something called the United Jupiter Republic.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.430
That's good reasoning for a boy.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.760
He looks at me like I'm a stranger.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.230
Get away!

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.260
You gonna chomp on me all day?!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.960
I protest violence! I protest corporal punishment!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.060
Is Üso mad about something?

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.230
Suzy, take care of Karl.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.330
Sure.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.500
What's wrong?

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:05.130
My dad's giving me the cold shoulder, and it's weird!

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.060
I figured it was that.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.000
There were a lot of big wigs there, right?

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:12.200
He won't act like he did in Kasarelia. It's obvious.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.530
Even so!

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.860
Men are creatures who can never be honest.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.860
They even write novels about it.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.030
You think?

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.600
Even our dad is like that.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:23.760
I guess.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.230
Don't act so spoiled!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.300
Even if all you do is fight with your dad...

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.960
Be grateful for that!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.930
I understand that, but...

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.200
Your dad is working as hard as he can...

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:38.060
...dealing with the Federation higher-ups as "Jinn Jahannam."

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.400
You mean he's leading the League Militaire single-handed?

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:44.400
Yeah, while you have the luxury of pouting about it.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.800
You're spoiled!

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:49.460
Yeah. He's not that figurehead double on the Reineforce Junior.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:50.900
He's for real!

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.830
Why are we standing by?!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.930
If the saucer suit rings its bells,

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:02.030
we've got that new mobile suit shield ready to go!

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.600
Calm down. Calm down.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:07.700
Wow, the real Jinn Jahannam has really motivated him.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.800
We've got reinforcements coming from other colonies!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.160
That Angel Halo of theirs is nothing but a big ring!
Leonid.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.660
All we need for that...
His Excellency wants to beat the Jeanne d'Arc.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:19.260
...is a strategy centered around the mega beam shield!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.230
You just keep screaming at us...

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:26.100
No, no, we mustn't oppose the great Jinn Jahannam's decision.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:26.900
Eh?

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:28.800
Exactly!

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.800
Karel, entering!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:35.160
We're attacking under orders from the Reineforce Junior's Jinn Jahannam?

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.630
Figured it was something like that.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:41.300
Since when does the real one take orders from the fake?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.860
Do family relationships get severed during war?

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.130
The objective of this operation...

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:52.160
...will be the elimination of the fleet on Angel Halo's perimeter.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.660
Since ancient times, some wars have pitted families against each other.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.930
You let the Reineforce Junior issue the order.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.630
Seeing how that act marks you as a man of wisdom,

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.860
don't you think you should have been a bit more fatherly?

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:12.460
As much as you say that, General, the other generals wouldn't agree.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:16.430
I understand your concerns, but maybe you defer to the others too much.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:22.330
White Ark unit, Juca and the rest, launch.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:23.930
Okay. All set?

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.460
Odelo, Tomáš! Here we go!

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:34.800
Just as I had Myra, Üso, you have Shahkti.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.000
That should be enough.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.930
Well? Doesn't it feel good, being up so high?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.300
This is Kasarelia!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.460
What if we fall?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.430
Don't you trust your dad?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.400
No, it's not that. It's not.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:00.560
Then that's enough. That's enough.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:02.900
Üso!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.200
Üso, can I have that shield?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.160
I'll use it better than you!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.230
If you think I'm depressed, you've got me all wrong.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.130
Possible recon unit, closing!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.060
Roger.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.360
Üso Ewin, here I go!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:21.560
Wait! He's trying to act so tough.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:28.130
Odelo, I know you like playing big brother to him, but our job is to fly support!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.730
Does the whole world revolve around Üso?

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.430
You can't run an organized battle without someone being at the center!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.830
Theory is theory!

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.330
Üso isn't always the best one!

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:40.330
Miss Juca!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.930
You two are chattering...

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.630
...on an open channel in front of the enemy?!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:45.630
If you need to chat,

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:49.200
touch suits and do it through the skin touch circuit!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.630
Geez, they're such a bother!

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.100
You can't afford to hesitate on the battlefield!

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.130
I hear it... The fluttering of that boy's wings!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.330
Don't laugh so much, Fuala.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.600
Why not?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:33.730
It was you who lured those boys out into space.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.600
And such darling boys they are.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.860
And you showed the Zanneck to them.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.230
The better to show them my love.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:42.430
I'm talking about the Newtype.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:48.100
The one piloting the Gundam, who makes beam wings come from a machine of war.

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.630
And I'm even better.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:55.930
I'll hit the League Militaire and take you right to Angel Halo.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:58.330
That's what you want, isn't it?

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:00.000
Yes, I do.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.930
Then I'll do it for you.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:04.930
Kyl!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:05.830
Ma'am?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:10.400
I'll let you fire the Zanneck's cannon in my place. Follow me.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:11.400
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.330
There's a second seat?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.830
Look at this thing. Of course there is.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.600
That's it. Treat it like a woman.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:35.700
Y-Yes...

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:39.360
Narrow the beam and pick off the white one.

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:41.630
But, at this range, how do I identify it?

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.800
I'll identify it!

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:45.160
R-Right!

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.660
At... At this range?

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:59.730
Open your mind's eye. Listen to the echoes of light in space.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:03.460
Right .2 degrees, up .01. Fire!

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.230
It's still coming.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:19.900
That beam...

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.960
I feel like it was aimed at me. Another one?!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.530
Üso's V2!

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.760
You've done enough, Miss Miliera! Please, pull back!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.130
You're okay, right? Here comes another one!

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:38.230
Sorry. Be careful!

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:50.860
If you're aiming at anyone, aim at me!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:56.600
Just as I wanted. The boy's appeared. Now go!

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:57.260
Right!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.130
The V2 has a long-range cannon, too!

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:09.200
He's gotten eager to chase us, hasn't he?

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.460
Let's pressure him even more.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.200
Right!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.600
This cannon decreases my mobility. But...

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:25.000
It's no use! Lt. Commander Fuala, the cannon isn't up to this!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:28.800
You can do it, Kyl. I have great expectations for you, as a pilot.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:33.200
You haven't taken me down yet, Boy.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.400
All I'm doing is letting the enemy lead me around.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.260
Are they treating me like a child?!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:58.700
Damn!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.930
Is the enemy abandoning the fight?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:12.460
Is... Is she surrendering?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.530
No, she isn't!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.660
W-Who is she?

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.960
You, pilot.

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:23.230
I know you're the boy I met in the harbor that day.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.960
What's she...

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:30.430
I'll give you a taste of the fear I felt!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:36.160
The terror of when I was cast into space!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:48.260
If I'm going to lose my mind, I'd rather just cut my normal suit open!

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:56.430
Lt. Commander Fuala, are you all right?

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.860
Who are you?

00:12:57.900 --> 00:13:02.530
Ma'am! We're here on orders from Captain Tassilo Wago to rescue you.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.700
What?!

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.000
He was the one who had me spaced to begin with!

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:11.630
Yes. He did it to trick Cronicle, Kagatie, and Sugan.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:16.430
Tassilo was planning to force Kagatie out.

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:21.430
His plot was uncovered, and he was sentenced to the guillotine with you.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.430
Why must I, too, be executed?!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:29.060
But, thanks to the Gundam Team's timely uprising,

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:32.200
Tassilo escaped the guillotine and disappeared.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:38.160
Later, Kagatie decided to use Tassilo again to defend Angel Halo.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:42.230
The games the higher-ups play are so annoying.

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:47.160
But all I remember is being cast away in space for two days!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.360
I swear, I'll shoot!

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:56.330
Is this what Fuala wanted?! I'll finish him, then!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.330
Is it on remote control?!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:11.400
Are you hurt?

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:11.930
Out!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:12.900
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.600
Getting hit by even one particle from a mega particle gun...

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:18.160
...should kill a person instantly!

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.300
You had the beam set too narrow!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.900
You'll never replace Metchet.

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.500
Okay, Boy...

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.360
Can you beat me without your shield?

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:36.760
That boy has reinforcements?

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:38.900
The Federation Forces are coming in, too?!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.930
I nearly had him, and then you people interfered!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.030
If I widen the beam...

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:55.230
Where did this Federation unit come from?

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.460
Hey, pilot! You still alive?

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:01.300
Yeah, I'm fine! Where'd this unit come from?

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:02.530
The Jeanne d'Arc!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.860
The Jeanne d'Arc! Dad...

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:08.100
He's been watching me fight all along!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.230
Üso, replace your Hanger, quickly!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.700
I know!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:18.760
Dammit, I've just been pouting like a little kid!

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.860
Send me a Hanger! Actually, send me some Boots, too!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.860
What are you planning, Üso?

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.760
To borrow a tactic from Mr. Mathis!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.130
We don't have time to ready a spare shield!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.630
Besides, the units from the Jeanne d'Arc are already engaging them!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.300
Withdraw! Pull back!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.300
Üso apparently has an idea.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:46.160
How will he fight without decent weapons?! We can't waste our lives!

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.300
There's valor in retreat, too!

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:50.760
No, this is the time for action!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:54.360
Mobile suit deck, prep a Hanger and Boots for launch, now!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:58.460
On it! Launch the Hanger first, then send the Boots in sequence!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.530
Üso's up to something again, huh?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.060
Here they come, Üso!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.400
Roger! Bearing, good!

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:15.160
Launching Boots! Go!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.360
They've launched a set of V2's Boots?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.400
If you need Boots, you can use mine, Üso!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.200
Thank you!

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:34.030
Just please keep me covered, Miss Cony!

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.100
Using several Boots... Isn't that tactic...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:46.660
That was a tactic from Mr. Mathis Walker from Largaine, right?

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:53.060
It's certainly a good idea, but he has even more planned.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:54.030
What?

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:58.060
Üso's going to take on the mobile suit making the bell noises.

00:16:58.260 --> 00:16:59.960
He is?

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:02.560
Yeah, he is, isn't he?

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.960
Cover Üso, you got that?!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.100
Roger that! Roger that!

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:12.760
The bells! They're coming from that airspace.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.560
Yes, yes...

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:19.860
Have you come to play with me some more, Boy?

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.560
I'll send the Boots straight in!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:36.960
Above me!

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:47.100
The boy didn't respond to me! You annoying flies!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.900
Where is that boy?

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.200
I'm sorry!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.830
Victory!

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:09.230
Now the bells of the guillotine will be silenced, Miss Fuala!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:14.700
If you don't finish me, the bells of the guillotine will always ring!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.100
Die!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.960
We've lost the Zanneck's ID signal.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.360
Withdraw our mobile suits from their firing range!

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:37.260
Sir!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:41.200
Press them with the Tassilo Fleet! Smash the League Militaire Fleet!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:52.100
Second wave of missiles, incoming!

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:54.000
Is anyone nearby?

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:56.500
No one. We can't get any support.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.260
Set course to retreat!

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:00.060
What course?

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:03.130
Miss Marbet, if we don't do something...

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.630
We're going into Angel Halo's airspace!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:06.800
R-Right!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.100
It's okay, Shahkti.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:20.360
The White Ark's moving away from all the ship fire.

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:22.360
We're okay.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:24.460
Because Miss Marbet is in command.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:28.700
But I still have a terrible feeling about this.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.660
What? Shahkti called out to me.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:34.460
Who?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.930
Üso, are you going into the enemy fleet?

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.060
Give us a command if you want us to take formation!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.200
The White Ark has separated and is acting on its own!

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.960
It's drifting into Angel Halo's airspace!

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:48.860
What?

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:52.330
Considering the White Ark's firepower, if it flies into the middle of the enemy...

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:53.700
It'll just be destroyed!

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:54.630
Right!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.730
And I can't just leave the White Ark when Elisha's aboard it!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.460
The enemy's main force is moving up!

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.900
Ahead, full! Don't hesitate!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:17.330
We've been spotted! Don't follow us!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:29.030
The only ones left around us are the Shrike Team?!

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:32.500
The White Ark is drifting toward Angel Halo.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.660
And the boys went after it?!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:35.900
Of course.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:38.730
It's too dangerous to go in any further!

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:41.460
Let's leave the rest to General Mubarac, okay?

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.560
I suppose we could, but...

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.360
But, should we just leave this to a bunch of kids?

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.830
No, they always manage to figure something out.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.030
Is everyone okay?!

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.530
What's up?

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.300
What's wrong?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.460
There it is.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.700
The real Angel Halo.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:15.060
We're still far away, but... But you can see its shape clearly.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.530
Angel Halo...

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.060
I warned you, Fuala.

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:43.830
About what? I didn't die.

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:48.560
There are still a lot of machines on this ship, right?

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:49.600
Yes.

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:52.400
Our fleet has already tried a battle by cannon,

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:55.930
and now the League Militaire's been drawn toward Angel Halo.

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:59.260
Both Kagatie and Sugan should be on Angel Halo now.

00:21:59.530 --> 00:22:01.500
They must be terrified.

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:04.200
Yes, I imagine they are.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:34.830
To stop this battle from spreading any further,

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:38.000
I decide to meet with my mother, Maria.

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:41.260
But, that only leads to misunderstandings.

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:43.560
And then I see them.

00:23:43.930 --> 00:23:46.360
Two soldiers, so in love that they...

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.960
...stab each other with their beams!

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:53.700
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:57.000
Next Episode LOVE LIES AT THE END OF LIGHT
"Love Lies at the End of Light".

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.700
Please watch it!
Next Episode LOVE LIES AT THE END OF LIGHT
